{"title":"Career Roadmap · BIM Specialist","role":"BIM Specialist","summary":"A BIM Specialist develops, manages, coordinates, and maintains digital building information models throughout the architectural and construction lifecycle.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A BIM Specialist develops, manages, coordinates, and maintains digital building information models throughout the architectural and construction lifecycle."},{"type":"p","text":"For a B.Arch graduate, the strongest positioning is to combine architectural knowledge + BIM software + construction documentation + multidisciplinary coordination + BIM data management."},{"type":"p","text":"A BIM Specialist is not simply a person who creates 3D models. The role increasingly involves:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"BIM modeling and documentation"},{"text":"Architectural model development"},{"text":"BIM standards and workflows"},{"text":"Model coordination"},{"text":"Clash detection"},{"text":"Construction documentation"},{"text":"Family/component creation"},{"text":"Quantity and information extraction"},{"text":"Multidisciplinary coordination"},{"text":"BIM quality control"},{"text":"Common Data Environment (CDE) workflows"},{"text":"BIM automation"},{"text":"Digital twins and information management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Career Flow"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Arch","Architectural Design + Construction Fundamentals","CAD + Revit Fundamentals","BIM Modeling + Documentation","Families + Parameters + BIM Standards","Architecture + Structure + MEP Coordination","Clash Detection + Model QA/QC","BIM Documentation / Coordination Internship","BIM Modeler / BIM Coordinator","BIM Specialist","Senior BIM Specialist / BIM Coordinator","BIM Manager / Digital Delivery Lead","BIM Consultant / Digital Construction Lead"]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"ta